msgctxt "64"
msgid ""
"Wow, Kiryu-san. <Color:255,200,200,255>⑮<Color:Default> You were sooo "
"amazing back there! Ohmigosh, I can't stop smiling about it. "
"<Color:255,200,200,255>⑮<Color:Default><Color:255,200,200,255>⑮<Color:Default><Color:255,200,200,255>⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "76"
msgid "Thanks."
msgstr "Grazie."

msgctxt "88"
msgid ""
"You really helped forget about all the bad stuff I'm dealing with right now."
" I feel, like, so much better. <Color:255,200,200,255>⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "100"
msgid ""
"But now I know that I'm gonna be okay, no matter where I am in the world. "
"I'm gonna work my butt off! <Color:255,200,200,255>⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "112"
msgid "I know you will. Good luck."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "124"
msgid "Thanks. I'm gonna go talk to Mina, okay?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "136"
msgid ""
"Kiryu-san... <Color:255,200,200,255>⑮<Color:Default> Thank you so much, "
"really. <Color:255,200,200,255>⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "148"
msgid ""
"I'm really gonna miss you... but I'm so lucky to have had you in my life. "
"<Color:255,200,200,255>⑮<Color:Default><Color:255,200,200,255>⑮<Color:Default><Color:255,200,200,255>⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

